      "kind": "list",
      "start_line": 51,
      "end_line": 59,
      "raw": "- `~/.local/SDK/iiXml/lib`: iiXml 공유 라이브러리\n- `~/.local/SDK/iiXml/include/iiXml`: `#include <iiXml>`용 umbrella 헤더\n- `~/.local/SDK/iiXml/include/iiXml.h`: 기존 파일명 기반 umbrella 헤더\n- `~/.local/SDK/iiXml/include/Src`: 모듈별 공개 헤더\n- `~/.local/SDK/iiXml/lib/cmake/iiXml`: `iiXmlConfig.cmake`와 export target 파일\n- `~/.local/SDK/iiXml/platforms/macos`: macOS 전용 패키지 mirror\n- `~/.local/SDK/iiXml/platforms/ios`: iOS 전용 패키지\n- `~/.local/SDK/iiXml/platforms/android`: Android 전용 패키지\n- `~/.local/SDK/iiXml/platforms/wasm`: WASM 전용 정적 패키지\n",
